🧪 Connectivity Testing

After configuring the network, connectivity was tested using the ping command.

Example:

ping <destination-ip>

Successful ping responses were used to verify communication between network devices.

🔍 Network Verification

The following Cisco IOS commands were used for verification and troubleshooting:

show ip interface brief
show running-config
show ip route
ping <destination-ip>
traceroute <destination-ip>

These commands helped verify:

Interface status
IP address configuration
Routing information
Device-to-device connectivity
Network communication paths
